RjiQatsZ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 13","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14237","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"104103","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"38083","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"82692","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"353579","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"57407","synopsis":"建造中の征天を破壊しようとする反抗軍と、それを撃退しようとする太白帝国との決戦が行われる。事件のすべてを理解した皇帝・澄は、罪の意識にさいなまれていた。釗は、澄への書簡を梨香に預けると、戦場からの避難を促す。龐夫人の失敗を知った蒙機関総帥は、自分の計画が明るみに出る前に作戦を実行に移す。そこは、互いの総力がぶつかり合う戦場。心を失って姉を憎む寧と、妹を救おうとする殷が出会う。そして刃が交わり――。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h50mZvdPo8hEVXAom2cteEEa5y8.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 13","synopsis":"建造中の征天を破壊しようとする反抗軍と、それを撃退しようとする太白帝国との決戦が行われる。事件のすべてを理解した皇帝・澄は、罪の意識にさいなまれていた。釗は、澄への書簡を梨香に預けると、戦場からの避難を促す。龐夫人の失敗を知った蒙機関総帥は、自分の計画が明るみに出る前に作戦を実行に移す。そこは、互いの総力がぶつかり合う戦場。心を失って姉を憎む寧と、妹を救おうとする殷が出会う。そして刃が交わり――。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h50mZvdPo8hEVXAom2cteEEa5y8.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}}],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-30T07:57:40Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:104103","mal:38083"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14237","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"104103","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"38083","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"82692","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"353579","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}}]},"artworkInventory":{"logo":[{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://live.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt9214568/img"}],"poster":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w81JEUz8yWClgQNhA5hMPe5AO3d.jpg"},{"source":